Loom: the inline-accumulator iu4 WMMA forms (`.acc_zero`, `.acc_inv_2pi`) get their own measured gfx1151 placement
preference: 16 cycles iff A and B start in different VGPR banks (mod 4), else 17. 0031 qualified only the
register-accumulator form, so the k-step-0 WMMAs of every tile landed with A and B in one bank. The generated
placement bindings now carry a preference index per qualification. Steady-loop WMMA issue: gu 16.16 -> 16.00 cycles,
plain/kres 16.19 -> 16.06; bit-identical results, pp2048 cycles -0.6%.
